---
# WORKFLOW of the local-mode certification (scripts/e2e_local.sh). `@VAR@` placeholders are
# filled by run.py: the omp binary, the model and the throwaway git repository.
tracker:
  kind: memory
polling:
  interval_ms: 15000
hooks:
  after_create: |
    set -eu
    git clone -q "@REPO@" .
  timeout_ms: 60000
agent:
  max_concurrent_agents: 1
  max_turns: 1
  input_timeout_ms: 60000
engine:
  command: "@OMP@ --mode rpc"
  provider: "@PROVIDER@"
  model: "@MODEL@"
  thinking: low
  read_timeout_ms: 15000
---
You are working on ticket {{ issue.identifier }}: {{ issue.title }}

{{ issue.description }}

Work only inside the current directory, one shell command per step, and do not commit, push or
call linear_graphql. If a human message arrives while you work, do what it asks as well. When
everything is done, reply with a one-line summary.
